<title>INDONESIA: TABLE-Indo-Rama says first-half net up sharply.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Indo-Rama says first-half net up sharply.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			    (in billion rupiah except per share)</p>
<p>    Net profit			 72.88	 vs	 45.02</p>
<p>    Net sales			  426.23	vs	 319.18</p>
<p>    Annualised EPS (rupiah)	 225	  vs	 140</p>
<p>    Gross profit		    111.35	 vs     65.66</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 80.19	 vs     45.46</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		   72.88	 vs     48.47</p>
<p>    Retained earnings		411.37	vs    292.21</p>
<p>NOTE: The consolidated results were unaudited. PT Indo-Rama Synthetics is one of Indonesia's largest integrated polyester and resin manufacturers.</p>
